{"type":"match","data":{"path":{"text":"www.fitnyc.edu/Entrepreneurship Speaker Series.txt"},"lines":{"text":"As one of the most photographed women in the industry, Mallis is widely and consistently quoted in the fashion press and broadcast media, especially on The Business of Fashion. She has been frequently featured on televised fashion and news magazine programs, including Project Runway, America's Next Top Model, She's Got the Look, and The Fashion Show, withIsaac Mizrahi and Kelly Rowland. She was also a consulting producer on the CW network's reality television series ReModeled.\n"},"line_number":275,"absolute_offset":36956,"submatches":[{"match":{"text":"consulting producer"},"start":405,"end":424}]}}
