{"type":"match","data":{"path":{"text":"www.cannescorporate.com/Jury 2025.txt"},"lines":{"text":"Ellen directed Rebuilding Hope: The Children of 911 on the 20th anniversary of the tragedy. She executive produced Afghan Dreamers about the courageous and undaunted members of the all-girls robotics team that challenged a hostile culture to show the world and its own community how education and opportunity can uplift an entire nation and especially its women. The team continues to make headlines even as its members live in exile, forced to flee their homeland as the Taliban threatens their lives and the promising futures of Afghanistan's girls and women. She is consulting producer on Fire Through Dry Grass, winner of best documentary at the Black Star film festival, which has its premiere on the PBS series POV.\n"},"line_number":133,"absolute_offset":21963,"submatches":[{"match":{"text":"consulting producer"},"start":569,"end":588}]}}
